sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cmp as PTI · Compliance
  participant BO as Supplier · Back Office
  Note over Cmp: Compliance Tracker has no menu item and no My tasks item
  Cmp->>Cmp: Compliance Tracker (URL only) · Ask for a document, Open the request · Document → Awaiting Upload
  Cmp-->>BO: no To do task for a new request (To do counts only expired or expiring certificates)
